{"reviews":[{"id":"B085DP826T-0","r":5.0,"t":"WORTH YOUR MONEY!","x":"I love this hair! It is very soft, thick, and easy to twist with. I only used about 3 1/2 packs and paid less than i would if i bought them from the beauty supply store, so I can confidently say that this hair is well worth the money! 10/10 would recommend","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B085DP826T-1","r":5.0,"t":"Great price, light, extra hair, perfect length!","x":"[[VIDEOID:92e547a3355b061b92a928c9a4e145c4]] This is AMAZING! I honestly wasn\u2019t sure what to expect, but it came with 6 packs, I only used 3 for my whole head and I did them small, so definitely worth it, the hair is soooo light it honestly feels like there\u2019s nothing in your hear, you can throw it up in a bun, ponytail, anything and won\u2019t feel it pulling or tugging, I really like the hair, it\u2019s super soft as well, I recommend separating the curls for the strands of hair if you want a fuller chun","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B085DP826T-2","r":5.0,"t":"Great price, light, extra hair, perfect length!","x":"[[VIDEOID:92e547a3355b061b92a928c9a4e145c4]] This is AMAZING! I honestly wasn\u2019t sure what to expect, but it came with 6 packs, I only used 3 for my whole head and I did them small, so definitely worth it, the hair is soooo light it honestly feels like there\u2019s nothing in your hear, you can throw it up in a bun, ponytail, anything and won\u2019t feel it pulling or tugging, I really like the hair, it\u2019s super soft as well, I recommend separating the curls for the strands of hair if you want a fuller chun","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B085DP826T-3","r":5.0,"t":"Loved it","x":"Loved this product, used one strand for mini passion twist. It looked super natural.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B085DP826T-4","r":5.0,"t":"Great bang for my buck","x":"I used this product to put passion twist in my hair. I really don\u2019t have any complaints about it. I received a lot of great compliments!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B085DP826T-5","r":5.0,"t":"Twist are long lasting!","x":"Great product and the twist last throughout restyling \ud83d\ude0a","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B085DP826T-6","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE THIS HAIR","x":"Great hair, great value I will be buying again This hair is awesome! It\u2019s super soft and lightweight. It\u2019s easy to twist with the pattern you can clearly see if you are twisting against the wave pattern and fix it... I will be buying again and using this hair on others as well because they have asked me to do their hair after seeing how mine turned out. I wear it two days , really lightweight and comfortable, i got lots of compliments from my friends ,Would definitely recommend.Buy this hair you","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B085DP826T-7","r":3.0,"t":"Looks nice in the picture","x":"This hair is heavy when crocheted into the head and you have to make sure you use enough strands or else you will have empty spots on your head. It was also difficult to install. It has loops, but they should be a little bigger because of the strand of hair itself. It kept getting caught when it was pulled through.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B085DP826T-8","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome purchase","x":"I got my hair done with passion twist and the hair was provided by the person who did it and the hair was awful. So I decided to try this hair. THE HAIR IS SO GOOD THE GIRL WHI DOES MY HAIR ASK ME TO ORDER IT FOR HER. \ud83d\ude09Great purchase. The hair is lit shinning and easy to take care of.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B085DP826T-9","r":5.0,"t":"Good Quality & Long Lasting","x":"Shiny, thick easy to install high quality twists! . I use it for thickness and as a protective style in my natural curly mid-back length hair. Twists hold up through multiple washing and with good maintenance last 2-3 month before a new install is neeeed.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B085DP826T-10","r":5.0,"t":"Great hair for the price","x":"Loved this hair ! It came on time , very soft , easy to split  the hair is super light so when I put them in a bun it wasn\u2019t heavy on my head an it came with just enough hair for my whole head  ! I\u2019ll def be ordering more when I get this style again ...","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B085DP826T-11","r":5.0,"t":"Braiders love this hair...","x":"1B 24 inch....GREAT HAIR....GREAT BUY the hair was easy for my braided to work with extra soft not heavy at all very natural looking  I was skeptical buying hair online but this was a great experience \ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udffd\ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udffd\ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udffd\ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udffd","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B085DP826T-12","r":5.0,"t":"The hair does not come twisted like in the photo. You have to create the twist yourself.","x":"I thought the hair was going to come twisted like it said in the picture but it came wavy like this,so I decided to leave it as is! It came out very good so far and the hair is very soft! Would recommend","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B085DP826T-13","r":3.0,"t":"6 out of 10","x":"The hair looks very nice when put in, but the ends are very fizzy and tangled. I tried to dip the ends which just resulted in them getting more tangled and intertwined with each other.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B085DP826T-14","r":5.0,"t":"Quick. Easy. Economical.","x":"You will have more than enough to do a full head of hair. Hair is very thick. The hair is nice and soft comfortable to sleep on. Not stiff. Good value for the money.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B085DP826T-15","r":2.0,"t":"Might not get whats advertised","x":"I could not have got the hair advertised. The hair was horrible. It would knot, tangle and shed. I would braid  it up at night and still have these issues.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B085DP826T-16","r":5.0,"t":"Perfection!","x":"Super soft hair that creates perfect twists every time! 4 packs gave me 33 total so I have more left over for touch ups. Definitely worth every penny","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B085DP826T-17","r":4.0,"t":"Good product for passion twist.","x":"Like the hair quality and was very easy to work with.. went to reorder but don\u2019t like the new price point but overall good product to work with.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B085DP826T-18","r":5.0,"t":"Passion Braid hair","x":"[[VIDEOID:cb9965ed549686194af0829fed39d805]] Great hair for the price.. so far i have purchased twice already and i will definitely but again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B085DP826T-19","r":5.0,"t":"Love the hair!","x":"I cut it in half and only used 2 packs. I'm able to get at least 2 hairstyles with this. It blends with my hair very well.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B085DP826T-20","r":5.0,"t":"I like the price I know I would've spent more some place else.","x":"I definitely liked this hair so much.  Glad O bought more packs and the price beats the beauty supply store any day.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B085DP826T-21","r":3.0,"t":"They didn\u2019t last very long","x":"[[VIDEOID:1ba03ee3dfaee1b06d1b52541cdb8850]] My hair slipped out of these fast but they were good while the lasted","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B085DP826T-22","r":5.0,"t":"pretty good","x":"This hair allow me to create beautiful  butterfly  locs and then later twist.. I will purchase  again  for sure.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B085DP826T-23","r":5.0,"t":"Really soft and easy to work with","x":"It was really soft and easy to use for twists. The length was really nice too came to mid lower back and I\u2019m 5\u20197","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B085DP826T-24","r":5.0,"t":"super nice!!","x":"i actually really liked this hair! it was easy to use even tho it was my first time doing passion twists!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the hair as soft and lightweight.","cites":[1,2,7,11,12,13,15]},{"text":"Many say it is a great value, with enough hair for a full head and cheaper than beauty supply stores.","cites":[1,2,5,7,11,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers find it easy to install and twist with.","cites":[1,7,9,10,12]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the hair is heavy or difficult to install, with small loops and empty spots if too few strands are used.","cites":[8]},{"text":"A few mention the ends get fizzy and tangled, and that the hair arrives wavy rather than pre-twisted.","cites":[13,14]}]},"qa":[]}